{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/606767-spirit-influence-as-gifts","id":606767,"title":"Spirit Influence as Gifts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-29T10:06:40-07:00","id":606767,"title":"Spirit Influence as Gifts","content":"After realizing how fun it is to use the elemental gifts like something out of f*cking Avatar, I was wondering: is it viable to make Gifts that follow the same principles? Like, you take a form of Influence a spirit could have, and you convert it into a Gift that utilizes one of the Renown types + Primal Urge?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T10:14:29-07:00","id":606793,"title":"","content":"I suppose the easy way to do it is just to get a Fetish with the Influence you want.<br /> <br /> But I as an ST see no problem with getting a gift-set for it.<br /> I was in fact toying with it just after I first read the new gift set. Nothing serious, but thinking of it, y'know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T10:38:07-07:00","id":606832,"title":"","content":"I think the only hard part about it would be finding a gift that would be able to balance out having Spirit Influence in one facet with whatever's in all the other facets. Unless you find something in groups of four or five it might seem sort of an ill fit. I'd like to see something other than Catastrophe, in a group of four Influences, too. It's cool but more fitting with Elements than it would be anything else. All in all it's something I'd like to see again, but could see fall short on the creativity side of things.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, yes, like Seidmadr said, you could just use a fetish for it. There's an example in the book, I think called a storm coil. It only has three dots so it can't do much with electricity, so it's used mostly for shorting out existing systems. But give it another dot and you have a powerful stun gun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T13:07:45-07:00","id":606964,"title":"","content":"Eh, that sounds more like one effect only. I'm talking about manipulating things it like it were an extension of the body. Not just elements, either. Hell, if you wanted to make electricity, I always ST it where Fire can do that if you spend WP in addition to the normal cost. Indeed, you have to spend WP every time you wanna convert an element into a different state, eg water into ice and vice versa.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T13:53:02-07:00","id":607069,"title":"","content":"That's, sort of, also in the fetish section. At 3 dots it suggests letting a fetish act as 'a modification to a specific Facet that allows it to be used in new ways.' It's limited in that it suggests a set new way, not changing your elemental gift into any other element.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T15:21:26-07:00","id":607174,"title":"","content":"Yeah, fetish/talen would work better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}